{
 "batchId": "b-0112",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "es",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_820fde236567eaed74cb",
   "sourceHash": "820fde236567eaed74cb9b8420329729069b1ef297c96ef5e9c7dcb25369679b",
   "text": "Qué ocurrirá durante la sesión",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_00ea70486dabbf3a3c9c",
   "sourceHash": "00ea70486dabbf3a3c9cdddb24c56fd9a47f59145eda9ce79187157b35657292",
   "text": "Las cinco partes del Panchakarma",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d5d69d37070087dc75c6",
   "sourceHash": "d5d69d37070087dc75c6207df34c7a149bf80ee714c1debed62a1d33a3473fab",
   "text": "Panch- (cinco) + Karma (acción) = Panchakarma[[TAG_1]]Siguiendo las antiguas metodologías védicas, el proceso de limpieza del Panchakarma purifica la mente y el cuerpo. Elimina las toxinas mediante 5 procesos de limpieza. En apenas 3 semanas, usted se siente sano, feliz y pleno.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3392917ceb5fe43d46e3",
   "sourceHash": "3392917ceb5fe43d46e3963cb88a77ac6e802197e2336817fcdd6a1d08eb9766",
   "text": "Vamanam",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d3d7930cfb1aea268cff",
   "sourceHash": "d3d7930cfb1aea268cff40cbc9eba0177802cbc38670bcc6cdd81b83e392216a",
   "text": "Equilibra el Kapha dosha mediante la emesis o el vómito, aporta oxigenación y refuerza la inmunidad.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb",
   "sourceHash": "2377f50c7d95af6fe4fb66d3f4ea13ee884d7076265b691a19979da2525b58c9",
   "text": "Virechan",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0f77a2bf75aad21415de",
   "sourceHash": "0f77a2bf75aad21415de6955bcac5f381a956db5755da9a6425a5020b20d9716",
   "text": "Equilibra el Pitta dosha mediante la purgación, refuerza la inmunidad, fortalece los procesos de absorción, secreción y metabolismo del intestino y oxigena el cuerpo.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_36c4233e71e604dfc978",
   "sourceHash": "36c4233e71e604dfc978c6136833a28d5df691504276273868534c7518a76e49",
   "text": "Vasti",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_48399a5837d18cfed432",
   "sourceHash": "48399a5837d18cfed4324b5f1380c9831740ef988ab2346002312dbd6e1fc952",
   "text": "Equilibra el Vata dosha y nutre el cuerpo, rejuvenece, desintoxica y fortalece el sistema nervioso. Considerada la reina de todas las terapias, trata y previene diversas enfermedades con rapidez.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source efficacy claim ('treats and prevents various diseases quickly') kept as in source, not strengthened — flag for Dr. Deepu John clinical review of the EN source."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc",
   "sourceHash": "cf3e85a43f4a2bf8f1fc58991dbf7c5a84749f3d4ccb99c9a0547ced8dae5463",
   "text": "Nasyam",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3538b00f6de9f7af8e77",
   "sourceHash": "3538b00f6de9f7af8e77a41a8c1dc7ddcf1b453ee02efcd869a7d5ee4e914ea2",
   "text": "Limpia las vías respiratorias superiores, y rejuvenece y nutre el cuerpo. Ayuda a desintoxicar y fortalecer el sistema nervioso, así como a tratar y prevenir las dolencias de la cabeza y el cuello.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b6a817051756a7f75f8",
   "sourceHash": "4b6a817051756a7f75f8f75df480347eaaf385a931be4e8e445fb56d15c28a94",
   "text": "Raktamokshana",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": "Sanskrit therapy name kept verbatim.",
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9a09c2a755def3f2f5b7",
   "sourceHash": "9a09c2a755def3f2f5b799c726eee87a541d4e00da76428569830ec7a35303a5",
   "text": "Proceso de extracción de sangre impura del cuerpo mediante sanguijuelas, agujas o cuernos. Purifica la sangre, mejora la circulación sanguínea y protege los tejidos sanos de la contaminación.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_632898deb9abba462f2d",
   "sourceHash": "632898deb9abba462f2de6d2b027dad48787870ddd81dd161d16ce2beb2cbba5",
   "text": "¿Todavía no sabe por qué?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_af3f72554a4897fb0f8b",
   "sourceHash": "af3f72554a4897fb0f8bc9d7c3e676717451477feea412af81df098e475bd297",
   "text": "Por esto necesita la terapia de Panchakarma",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eee1697c1fc146ea7f40",
   "sourceHash": "eee1697c1fc146ea7f401ee1d69421b7b6c20b3c2c9e6f17f79dc92a4f45043d",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]Ha acumulado muchas toxinas en su cuerpo.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a273e64fb089ab557c50",
   "sourceHash": "a273e64fb089ab557c50344a7ed3c2fb99b1327393c6d93e40887a05670450b9",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]Su tracto digestivo no funciona bien",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_debb506e3f93761c5a6c",
   "sourceHash": "debb506e3f93761c5a6c8c840b263d6a0aeef650a5d3d98a90cec703a9b2780c",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]Presenta síntomas como dolor de cabeza, dolores articulares, fatiga mental, somnolencia, estrés y apatía.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f04d9db3271d1d429e4b",
   "sourceHash": "f04d9db3271d1d429e4b44685af98d40e1b35a533991139137cae1509b1b24a0",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]No hace ejercicio ni practica yoga.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aff534b9dd3af53156be",
   "sourceHash": "aff534b9dd3af53156be1e13be19f8551aa0eb9da68c230d20b485287a1c9273",
   "text": "¿Sabía que…?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e25736593d07ce53e422",
   "sourceHash": "e25736593d07ce53e42282028ae43ccdffe8f2b81dad12b950fc53c942d65413",
   "text": "Un dato sorprendente",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2da",
   "sourceHash": "15561c4d2bf9b8a6c2dac297127db89b3b391f9f4e536afb165123c0d056f542",
   "text": "La Organización Mundial de la Salud informa de que la medicina tradicional se utiliza en más de 170 de sus 194 Estados miembros. El Panchakarma es uno de sus sistemas documentados más antiguos, y es lo que nuestros médicos practican aquí cada día. Cuando esté preparado para cuidarse como es debido, un médico ayurvédico le indicará por dónde empezar.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_849109ced4396a29e4cb",
   "sourceHash": "849109ced4396a29e4cbeeb72a5bdf72429bc910967faecb60ce5360ed3d7c01",
   "text": "Sí, quiero estar sano",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_466c15cbfedce229a3fc",
   "sourceHash": "466c15cbfedce229a3fc7e2fbc3eaf00dfabe592074fe6d2cf3fda0b64082a17",
   "text": "de los Estados miembros de la OMS declaran el uso de medicina tradicional: 170 de 194",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ae50b76b3de971284951",
   "sourceHash": "ae50b76b3de971284951327c802a806b0446fd0534eeec9d4b7cf15ad222002a",
   "text": "Cuidaremos de usted",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
